{"unit_id":"kezboardpj__dsh-skill-loader#card-zh","repo":"kezboardpj/dsh-skill-loader","commit":"07a6c197a090175650491d4a32fd2f67450b1917","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-loader 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的按对话技能清单选择器。它在新对话开始页提供技能选择面板，并将勾选技能的名称和描述载入当前对话。用户可用复选框或 /skill-select 命令调整清单；未选技能会从模型目录中过滤，相关手势和 skill 工具调用也会被拒绝。它还提供 /skill-unarchive 命令恢复归档会话。选择状态保存在 DSH settings 中，未选择过的对话沿用全部载入的默认行为。适合希望按任务精简可用技能目录的 DSH Web 用户；安装需 DSH 及其 Web 客户端运行时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:161-204","lib/index.js:53-85","lib/index.js:91-131"]}
{"unit_id":"kezboardpj__dsh-skill-loader#card-en","repo":"kezboardpj/dsh-skill-loader","commit":"07a6c197a090175650491d4a32fd2f67450b1917","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-loader lets DSH web users choose skills per conversation. Its start-page picker loads selected skills into the model catalog and filters unselected skills, gestures, and tool calls. Choices persist in DSH settings. Commands set the skill list or restore archived conversations.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:161-204","lib/index.js:53-85","lib/index.js:91-131"]}
